repository-code: https://github.com/Thavarshan/fetch-php
url: https://fetch-php.thavarshan.com
license: MIT
version: 3.8.0
date-released: '2026-07-22'
abstract: >-
  Fetch PHP is a modern PHP HTTP client library inspired by the
  JavaScript Fetch API. Built on Guzzle, it provides an async/await
  interface using PHP Fibers, a PSR-7/PSR-18 request/response model,
  middleware, lifecycle events, RFC 7234 caching, connection pooling,
  HTTP/2 support, streaming, Server-Sent Events parsing, and testing
  utilities.
keywords:
  - php
  - http
  - http-client
  - fetch
  - fetch-api
  - async
  - promises
  - fibers
  - guzzle
  - psr-7
  - psr-18
  - psr-3
  - middleware
  - streaming
  - server-sent-events
  - caching
  - rest-api
